+ * OmniVision OV64B40 image sensor driver
+ *
+ * One fixed mode: 4624x3472 RAW10 (2x2 binned), about 30 fps, three
+ * C-PHY trios at 1.684 Gsps from a 19.2 MHz MCLK. The register tables are
+ * the vendor sequences of a production camera module (Xiaomi Redmi Note
+ * 12 Turbo wide camera); the per-module calibration blocks the vendor
+ * loads from the module EEPROM are not written.
+ */
